{
  "$description": "The playful character (design language section 19): a toy or an appliance. Soft-touch rubber caps in bold colours (sky blue knobs, coral faders), glossy candy lacquers for the skirts, levers, bezels and plates (sun yellow, lime, cream, pink; a mint faceplate by day and a grape one in the dark), a bright high-key room, hot-pink lamps, bouncy underdamped springs with lively detents, a fat pointer and a bright, short, nearly noiseless sound set. A sparse validated theme layer: it sets only what differs from premium. Its values are the I5 tuning on the prototype page (look sign-off pending with the owner); `provisional` names every one of them but the role assignments.",
